{"articleNo":"227515","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=227515&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[대학원] [대학원]2019년 2학기 학자금대출 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2019.08.02","hit":"4527","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t2019년&nbsp;2학기&nbsp;학자금대출(일반/취업후상환)&nbsp;신청&nbsp;안내<br>\n&nbsp;<br>\n□&nbsp;학자금대출&nbsp;신청기간○&nbsp;등록금&nbsp;대출(일시납)<br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;신청:&nbsp;7.12.(금)&nbsp;~&nbsp;10.18.(금)&nbsp;14시까지<br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;실행:&nbsp;7.12.(금)&nbsp;~&nbsp;10.18.(금)&nbsp;16시(단,&nbsp;등록금&nbsp;수납&nbsp;마감시간&nbsp;이내)<br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;등록금대출한도&nbsp;:&nbsp;등록금&nbsp;전액<br>\n○&nbsp;생활비대출,&nbsp;분납연계대출(등록금),&nbsp;전환대출&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;신청:&nbsp;7.12.(금)&nbsp;~&nbsp;11.14.(목)&nbsp;18시까지<br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;실행:&nbsp;7.12.(금)&nbsp;~&nbsp;11.15.(금)&nbsp;17시(단,&nbsp;등록금&nbsp;은&nbsp;&nbsp;대학별&nbsp;&nbsp;수납&nbsp;&nbsp;마감시간&nbsp;이내)<br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;생활비&nbsp;대출한도&nbsp;:&nbsp;연&nbsp;300만원(학기당&nbsp;150만원)<br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※&nbsp;&nbsp;재학생&nbsp;생활비&nbsp;&nbsp;우선대출&nbsp;:&nbsp;등록&nbsp;전&nbsp;50만원&nbsp;한도&nbsp;내,&nbsp;등록&nbsp;후&nbsp;잔여&nbsp;생활비&nbsp;100만원&nbsp;대출&nbsp;가능<br>\n&nbsp;□&nbsp;한국장학재단&nbsp;홈페이지(www.kosaf.go.kr)&nbsp;또는&nbsp;모바일&nbsp;애플리케이션에서&nbsp;신청&nbsp;<br>\n□&nbsp;문의&nbsp;:&nbsp;한국장학재단&nbsp;☎1599-2000,&nbsp;&nbsp;대학원&nbsp;☎054-478-7039\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
